From f49996897079ed3a74fb30dd01d3feb801a9910c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vortiago <atle@havso.net>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:05:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ggml: count scheduler and CUDA work behind GGML_OP_STATS

One env gate reads once at init. Counters for the scheduler splits, input and
expert copies, syncs and host gate waits; and for CUDA, copy bytes, op
dispatches, stream syncs, CUDA graph captures/instantiates/updates/replays/
evictions and gate waits. A greppable report at request end and from the CLI,
and additive /metrics. Off by default; no cost when unset.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
